 * https://saint-paul-de-vence.taxi
 *
 * STANDALONE VERSION — All resources (3 photos + PDF brochure) embedded in this single file.
 * No /assets/ folder needed. Just upload this one file.
 *
 * Endpoints:
 *   ?asset=exterior  → serves the exterior photo (image/jpeg)
 *   ?asset=cabin     → serves the cabin interior photo
 *   ?asset=seats     → serves the rear seats photo
 *   ?download=brochure → serves TSPDV_Brochure.pdf as downloadable file
 */

// ===== Embedded resources (base64) =====

/* ─── i18n ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
